    <JobName.medicaldoctor_arcane>白咒医师</JobName.medicaldoctor_arcane>
    <JobDescription.medicaldoctor_arcane>以净化和预防守护船员的医生。拥有可编辑的医生底树与白咒分支。</JobDescription.medicaldoctor_arcane>
    <JobName.medicaldoctor_mystic>冥途医师</JobName.medicaldoctor_mystic>
    <JobDescription.medicaldoctor_mystic>从彼岸、血液与怪物遗骸中寻找答案的医生。拥有可编辑的医生底树与冥途分支。</JobDescription.medicaldoctor_mystic>
